WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.930
BULLY RESCUE! MR. IGUCHI

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.520
BROUHAHA

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.310
<i>What? Ikuta-senpai asked you out?</i>

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.230
<i>Yeah, yesterday.</i>

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.480
Oh, gosh! Guys, look at this!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.270
Hey, give me back my phone, Chinatsu!

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.820
Catch me if you can!

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.530
Hey, you gotta watch
where you're going when you walk.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.030
It was you, Mr. Iguchi. Don't scare me.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.740
It was me who was scared.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.620
<i>It's been six months since our homeroom</i>
<i>teacher, Mr. Iguchi, arrived at school.</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.710
<i>Looks like the students</i>
<i>have warmed up to him.</i>

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.040
<i>They still get scared,</i>
<i>just for a second, though.</i>

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Now he seems to have another issue.</i>

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:56.590
<i>The students have warmed up to me,</i>
<i>but I have another problem.</i>

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.640
He's breathing heavily.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.890
<i>Stop it, or you'll have to gain</i>
<i>their trust all over again.</i>

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.560
<i>I'm really concerned about you...</i>

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.890
<i>Nendou-kun!</i>

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.690
<i>-That guy, again.</i>
<i>-What should I do?</i>

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:06.980
<i>Let's kick him out.</i>

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.690
<i>How can I rescue him from bullying?</i>

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.150
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.110
<i>I've been watching over this class,</i>
<i>and I am so certain</i>

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:17.320
<i>that Nendou-kun is bullied</i>
<i>by several students,</i>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.120
<i>because nobody tries to get close to him.</i>

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.700
<i>They just don't like him.</i>

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<i>And I've heard other students</i>
<i>talking bad about him.</i>

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.080
-Isn't Nendou dumb?
-He really is.

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.250
<i>It's a mere fact.</i>

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:31.340
<i>And his hair! It's not normal</i>
<i>to have a hairstyle like that.</i>

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.340
<i>Who did that to him?</i>

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.260
<i>He did.</i>

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:37.050
<i>His chin is always swollen. Someone</i>
<i>must be practicing uppercuts on him.</i>

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.090
<i>It's a dimpled chin.</i>

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>Who is bullying him? I have to find proof!</i>

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.470
<i>He's too engaged in his work</i>
<i>to see objectively.</i>

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.930
<i>I have to keep an eye on him.</i>

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.140
Hey, Nendou.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:48.730
Your face looks dumb, as usual.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:49.980
Did you see the morning news?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.320
<i>Kaidou-kun and Kuboyasu-kun.</i>
<i>Are they his friends?</i>

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:59.240
<i>Kaidou-kun is one of the smartest kids.</i>
<i>Maybe he's venting his frustration on him.</i>

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.410
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:05.200
<i>Kuboyasu-kun is nice and polite,</i>
<i>but he might've been a bad student before.</i>

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.120
<i>Possible.</i>

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:10.580
<i>Kaidou-kun's hand is always bandaged.</i>
<i>Like a boxer!</i>

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.340
<i>Is it Kaidou-kun who's been</i>
<i>practicing uppercuts on him?</i>

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.250
<i>As I said, impossible.</i>

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:17.720
<i>Is Kuboyasu-kun also involved?</i>
<i>Don't gang members often rest like that?</i>

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.550
<i>So was he a gang member</i>
<i>before transferring here?</i>

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.640
<i>As I said, it's possible.</i>

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:26.180
<i>I don't want to suspect my students,</i>
<i>but I need to observe them for Nendou-kun</i>

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.480
<i>before it's too late.</i>

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:28.770
<i>What?</i>

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.690
<i>They left once they noticed</i>
<i>that I was watching them.</i>

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.320
<i>Are they hiding something from me?</i>

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.280
<i>Most people would leave</i>
<i>if you stared at them that way.</i>

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:37.740
<i>They are suspicious.</i>

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:38.650
<i>What's that?</i>

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:39.910
<i>You are suspicious.</i>

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:41.030
It's horrifying!
Please go and get the teachers now!

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:41.990
So suspicious!

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.910
Hi, Kaidou-kun and Kuboyasu-kun.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.160
Teruhashi-san!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:49.160
<i>She's the most popular girl at PK Academy.</i>
<i>There's even her fan club, "Kokomin's."</i>

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.080
<i>Looks like they're getting along with her.</i>

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.040
See ya!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.340
<i>I appear to make everyone happy</i>
<i>by performing as the perfect pretty girl.</i>

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.340
<i>We appreciate that.</i>

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.050
Hey, what's up?

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:01.260
<i>Greeting someone?</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.220
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.720
Hey, Kuboyasu-kun and Kaidou-kun!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:07.680
<i>Hairo-kun! He is our class president!</i>
<i>He is one of the best honor students!</i>

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.640
<i>Right, those three are good friends.</i>

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.060
<i>There is no way that Hairo-kun</i>
<i>bullies anyone or wouldn't stop bullies.</i>

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.150
What a relief. I just misunderstood.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.070
Nendou is...

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.820
<i>Did they say "Nendou"? I can't hear well.</i>
<i>I gotta get closer to them.</i>

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.200
He was disappointed that he wasn't able
to play against you in the PE class.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.280
That basketball game.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.870
<i>Just pretend like I'm passing by.</i>

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.040
Tell Nendou-kun,

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.000
"Come see me in the gym during a recess.
I'll beat you."

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.960
<i>What's this picture?</i>

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.000
<i>I can't believe Hairo-kun is also a bully.</i>
<i>I had no idea...</i>

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.670
<i>I'm no longer qualified as a teacher.</i>

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.130
What's wrong, Mr. Iguchi?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.220
-Nothing!
-There's definitely something wrong!

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.090
<i>He's causing too many misunderstandings.</i>

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.350
<i>Are you sure about this?</i>
<i>You can't believe your own students?</i>

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:50.520
<i>Believe them or not, not seeing the truth</i>
<i>is the same as escaping from it.</i>

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:51.600
<i>What? It's locked!</i>

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.980
-I locked the door to keep everyone out.
-Bring it on!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.190
<i>Oh, no! The key is in the school office.</i>

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.650
<i>What's that sound? I know!</i>
<i>It's the rhythmic sound</i>

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:00.610
<i>-of Nendou-kun's chin being punched.</i>
<i>-What kind of chin?</i>

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.780
<i>It's obviously the sound of a basketball.</i>

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.780
<i>Well, maybe I should unlock the door.</i>

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.500
-Damn, you've got one.
-The game has just begun.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:11.660
What?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.120
What's wrong?

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:14.580
<i>It's open!</i>

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.500
What are you guys doing?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.420
Mr. Iguchi?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.710
<i>They're bullying him!</i>

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.630
<i>Have it your way.</i>

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.880
<i>Later, his misunderstandings</i>
<i>were all cleared up.</i>

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.890
SUDDENLY BEGINS!
REAL REAL ESCAPE ROOM

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.180
Real escape room?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.640
Players solve mysteries in a closed room
in order to escape from the room.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:33.810
ESCAPE FROM UNDERGROUND MAZE

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.230
There's an event nearby. Want to go?

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.770
That sounds fun!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:43.150
I see. So you need to use your brain.
I understand why he is not involved.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.570
-That's the brain I want.
-<i>Congrats. You solved the first mystery.</i>

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:48.070
-Do you need me?
-No! Stay away!

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:50.540
<i>Let him join.</i>
<i>It's none of my business, though.</i>

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.000
Each team needs four players.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.910
Sorry, but Nendou can't do this.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.580
-A mutt would be better. Right, Saiki?
-<i>I have to figure out</i>

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:59.170
<i>how to escape from this team.</i>

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.420
-Can't Saiki come?
-Seriously?

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.840
Gotta find someone else.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.930
-Do you need me?
-No! We don't!

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.760
You shut up and stay there! Saiki, don't!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.890
Hey, that sounds fun. Let's go!

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.470
-But... Yeah...
<i>-He is a perfect fit.</i>

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.850
-Want to go to karaoke.
-Whatever. Wait! What?

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:13.770
TEMPLATE CONVO

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.190
<i>One has to be a dumb.</i>
<i>It's a template for a group.</i>

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.350
-Do you know where it is?
-Yeah, there's a map on this.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.190
-Let's go, then.
-Follow me.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.020
<i>Oh well. I managed to escape.</i>

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.240
<i>There's no way that a psychic like me</i>
<i>can enjoy that kind of game.</i>

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:27.570
<i>As far as I can teleport,</i>
Escape Room<i> is nothing but a joke.</i>

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.030
Welcome home, Ku-chan!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.370
<i>I guess they must have just started</i>
<i>playing </i>Escape Room.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.330
<i>Let's peek at them with my second sight.</i>

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:34.580
<i>Yes, they're playing.</i>

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.580
-Stop it!
-Let me out here!

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.290
<i>I don't think</i>
<i>they're supposed to play like that.</i>

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.750
-Is anybody there?
-Hey, help us!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.420
-I can't open this!
-Anybody?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.760
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.920
I can't believe this!

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.090
Excuse me! Anybody out there?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.720
This emergency button is not working.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.680
My cell has no signal.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.720
We're stuck in here! In this elevator!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.810
Real Real Escape Room<i> starts now.</i>

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.390
<i>Well, it's still early.</i>
<i>They will be rescued soon.</i>

00:05:56.480 --> 00:06:00.020
<i>Wait. Why are they</i>
<i>in such a derelict building?</i>

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:03.190
<i>Not a single person around.</i>
<i>The event venue should not be there.</i>

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:07.320
It should be alright. The event will be
held in this building. Someone should...

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.780
Kaidou-kun, about that.
Aren't we in the wrong place?

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:14.330
We just followed you here,
but you aren't good with directions.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.250
<i>-How can you say that?</i>
<i>-Because we didn't see anyone on our way.</i>

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.290
<i>We saw dogs!</i>

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:22.500
<i>Yeah, bunch of stray dogs. Isn't it</i>
<i>strange to see them on the streets?</i>

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:27.220
Right. I didn't feel right when we passed
four "No Entry" signs in a row.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.470
<i>Why did you keep going?</i>

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.300
-That means--
-It could be days before someone finds us.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.510
Help!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.470
-Anybody there?
-Anybody?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.390
Don't be fussy.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:39.230
Being fussy doesn't get you anywhere.
Let's find a solution.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.350
Nendou...

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.520
<i>He is so calm...</i>

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:45.070
<i>He's so reliable, like when we were</i>
<i>on that deserted island. So glad he came.</i>

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:48.400
Anyway, can I poo here?
I can't hold it any longer.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:50.610
-Poo?
-Yeah, holding it in since fourth period.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:51.820
Help!

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.450
-Seriously!
-Don't shake that. I can't hold it.

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.040
-Why didn't you go to the toilet?
-Make it pee instead!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.250
<i>Well, even if I try to bring help</i>
<i>using telepathy, nobody is around.</i>

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.880
<i>The elevator was already out of order,</i>
<i>so restoring time won't work either.</i>

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.460
<i>Well, let them help themselves.</i>

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.340
<i>I can give you a hand.</i>

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:10.180
-Shit! It can't be opened!
-Hey, don't say "shit."

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.470
If I had a pry bar...

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.090
That's too convenient to think...

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.390
There is...

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.350
-A pry bar?
-Why is it here?

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.350
<i>Who cares?</i>
<i>We can use this to open the door!</i>

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.560
<i>Let's do this!</i>

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.810
<i>I found a 1,000-yen bill under the carpet,</i>
<i>so I teleported a pry bar.</i>

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.150
-It's open! Let's get out!
-No, it's blocked by the wall!

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:27.900
The trapdoor is closed.
And it's too tight to squeeze through.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.820
Hey, there's something under the door.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.990
What's that?
Let me get on your shoulders to see it.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:35.830
It must be a device to open the door.
But seems like it requires a passcode.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.490
But we don't know the passcode.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:40.540
Why did they place the device up there?
What should we do?

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.830
Hey, look! The buttons are flashing!
Is that because we broke the door open?

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.340
-That's scary!
-Is it a bug?

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:50.260
Four, four, one, two, four, four,
one, two. I knew it! It's the passcode!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.550
<i>Of course, it was me.</i>

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.050
-It's open!
-Hairo, you did it!

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:54.180
Got access to the outside now.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:57.260
-But how can we get out?
-Yeah, it's too tight to get through.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.720
If we could get out from there...

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.850
We've already tried that.
It can't be opened from inside.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.190
-What are you eating? That's mine!
-It's over now.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.520
Screw you! Don't you understand
how important food is?

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.400
I'm disappointed in you!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.990
-Just give me the bag. I can poo in it.
-No! Don't do that!

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.410
What? There's something up there.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.990
The smell of the chips
must have lured them!

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.200
FOR EMERGENCY USE ONLY

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.790
Yeah! We could escape!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.450
<i>Well, what a bother...</i>

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.830
<i>All right!</i>
<i>Now we can go to the escape game!</i>

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:24.750
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:25.960
<i>That's enough of that.</i>

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.960
SPENDING THE WEEKEND WITH BEST FRIENDS

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.550
<i>It's Sunday.</i>

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:33.630
<i>Akechi.</i>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.890
Good morning.
Sorry to visit you without notifying you.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.100
<i>Just say what you want.</i>

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.390
You are at home on Sunday.
Don't you have any plans?

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:44.480
I'm a stay-at-home man, too.
And it's getting colder out there.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:47.400
I wonder where people go on weekends.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:51.230
Those people are so outgoing.
I wish I could have fun like they do.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.070
-I have very few friends...
-<i>When will he tell me why he is here?</i>

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.110
<i>Leave if you won't.</i>

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:59.870
Hold on. Ouch! Okay, okay! I'll tell you
why I'm here! Please open the door!

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.200
I was surprised. I didn't expect...

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.330
<i>Let me get back to gazing at the ceiling</i>
<i>in my room. He can't ruin...</i>

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.000
Who is he, Ku-chan? Your friend?

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.630
<i>Can you make two cups of coffee, please?</i>

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.840
-Sorry, he is shy.
-I was going to talk to the door all day.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.670
<i>It'll be horrible if he stays all day.</i>

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:17.220
-It's been a while.
-Right, I've seen you before.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:21.140
Remember me?
I was his classmate in elementary school.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.060
<i>She remembers him.</i>

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.600
-Moromezato-kun?
-I'm Akechi.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.520
<i>She doesn't.</i>

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.020
Right, Akechi-kun.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.560
My name is Akechi now.
It was Asumi back then.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.480
Sorry.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.860
I annoyed you when I peed in my pants,
so I rather hoped you'd forgotten me.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.570
-The boy who peed in his pants!
-Yes, it's me.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.110
I'm glad that I peed now.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.660
<i>Don't be proud of it.</i>

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.240
Ku-chan had very few friends
because of his psych...

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.200
I know his secret. Don't worry.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.120
Do you?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.080
<i>Yeah, somehow.</i>

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:48.000
Yes, we are best friends,
so we have nothing to hide.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:48.920
<i>Don't tell a lie.</i>

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.130
<i>Okay, she's making a duckface. That's it.</i>

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.090
<i>Have fun.</i>

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.050
Your mom is so nice.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:59.390
<i>Just say what you want already. Reading</i>
<i>your mind is hard when you think so much.</i>

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:03.430
You can read minds,
but you can't see the essence of a person.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.600
Of course, you couldn't read mine,
because I'm not here for anything.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:09.060
Do I need a reason
to visit my friend on the weekend?

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.110
<i>No, but--</i>

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.020
Right? Let's hang out.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.110
<i>I didn't say I would.</i>

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:15.030
Then I have no choice, I will leave.
Let me talk to your mom first.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:18.360
<i>So, you instantly figured out</i>
<i>the power dynamics in my family.</i>

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.320
Eat this!
Cyber punch!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.120
<i>Well, I don't understand what he wants.</i>

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.910
<i>I can't wait for the next episode,</i>
<i>but just watching TV is boring.</i>

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.420
-<i>How about some cake?</i>
-<i>I will never offer you cake.</i>

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.840
Kusuo-kun, I'm bored.
I want to eat some cake.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:33.750
<i>He said that out loud.</i>

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:34.670
HORSE RACING

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.670
And it's a boring horse racing show now.
I have an idea!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.140
Let's predict the winner of this race.

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.140
<i>Why should I?</i>

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.600
If you guess the winner,
I will leave promptly.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:46.310
If I win, please give me
the cake in the fridge.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.140
<i>Well, okay. I can do that.</i>

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.060
VIOLET ARROW

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.100
<i>Number two, Violet Arrow.</i>

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:52.190
You already picked one?
Why did you choose that one?

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:55.400
<i>I just read the mind of the guy</i>
<i>who looks like the biggest gambler.</i>

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.820
<i>My 40-year experience</i>
<i>tells me that's the one.</i>

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:57.940
Then my pick is...

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:02.240
Number eight, Tamakin Bomber.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.200
<i>What? It's the seventh most popular horse.</i>
<i>Even the name isn't promising.</i>

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.120
<i>Tamakin is fast!</i>
<i>Tamakin takes the lead now!</i>

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.040
<i>That sucks.</i>

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:12.500
<i>Tamakin won the race! Violet Arrow,</i>
<i>the most popular horse, finished in ninth.</i>

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.670
I instantly noticed
the horse was in great condition.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.800
Now...

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.670
-So slim.
-<i>I didn't say you'd get the whole piece.</i>

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.760
It's my own fault. I didn't predict
how childishly you would act.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.260
<i>Wanting someone's cake is not childish?</i>

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.720
-Yeah, but you didn't say...
-<i>Don't talk with your mouth full.</i>

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:32.150
<i>Okay, let's bet for the second race.</i>
<i>Winner gets this whole piece of cake.</i>

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.610
Sure. I'm fueled with sugar.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.190
<i>I will let you choose first.</i>

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.860
Okay, then...

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.650
I got it. Number five, Big Boobs.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.160
<i>Does the owner even love the horse?</i>

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.320
Have you picked one?

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:48.080
<i>I will. Second sight using telepathy,</i>
<i>here I go!</i>

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.250
Come on, number four!

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:53.000
<i>It's best to gather information</i>
<i>from the most involved parties.</i>

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.590
-<i>I should go easy with my twisted leg.</i>
-<i>So sleepy...</i>

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.000
<i>-I want to be free-range.</i>
<i>-My leg twisted?</i>

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.260
<i>I twisted my leg!</i>

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:01.090
<i>I twisted my leg due to weight gain?</i>

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.260
<i>I've twisted my front leg.</i>

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.180
<i>Too many twisted legs.</i>

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.140
<i>I’m on a roll!</i>

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.930
<i>That's him! Big Boobs!</i>
<i>No! I can't pick you!</i>

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:08.010
<i>Any other good horses?</i>

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.480
It's number nine!
Number nine will win the race!

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:15.400
<i>Big Boobs is fast!</i>
<i>Big Boobs finished in first place!</i>

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:16.310
Yum.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.230
<i>Finish it and leave.</i>

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:20.610
Kusuo-kun, looks like we can
think of more games to play.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:21.570
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:25.160
I mean, I can be your good friend.
Can I visit you again?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:28.990
<i>No, thanks.</i>

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.080
<i>I will be back.</i>

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.960
TORITSUKA VS. SATOU!
LOVE CONTEST! (FIRST VOLUME)

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:38.340
CLASS 2-2

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.630
-I am so sorry!
-It's nothing.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.170
We just went to get drinks.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.760
We never imagined that you'd
end up soaked with the drinks.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:46.800
It's nothing really.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.310
<i>How come we all spilled our drinks then?</i>
<i>Mine was even black coffee.</i>

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:51.220
<i>Mine was juice.</i>

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.520
<i>Mine was curry soup.</i>

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:54.100
I can wash them off.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.020
SOAKING

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.100
Your textbook is a mess, too.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.310
I need it for the next class.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.110
-Sorry! I forgot to bring my towel!
-Why today?

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.360
It's okay. I can manage it.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.280
Suzumiya-san.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.490
-You can use my towel.
-Satou-kun.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.700
DRIPPING

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.280
But I'd ruin your towel.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.490
Don't worry. And I will share my textbook
with you as my seat is next to you.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.250
Thank you, Satou-kun.
Can I move my desk closer to yours?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:13.290
Sure.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.330
<i>They look good together.</i>

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.000
Bastard! Keep your hands off my girl!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.000
<i>She's not yours.</i>

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:22.710
<i>He can erase bad things that happened</i>
<i>to her. He can make her happy.</i>

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.260
He can't make her happy! He has nothing!

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.300
<i>But he has no faults.</i>

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.550
If she isn't in love with me,
erasing her misfortune is meaningless.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.890
<i>You have nothing but faults.</i>

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.510
It's so hard to remove this stain.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:32.890
Toritsuka-kun.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.180
Hi, long time no see.

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:36.810
I was worried about you,
since you have been absent for a while.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:37.730
I was a bit busy.

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:38.650
<i>Well...</i>

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.400
What happened to your textbook?

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.030
Well, juice was spilled over this.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:44.240
But it's okay.
I will share my textbook with her.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:47.820
You don't have to do that.
She can use mine.

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:50.330
But then you won't have one.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.290
No worries. It's all in my head.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.540
Have you memorized everything?

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.540
-<i>It's my win.</i>
-Yeah, we've got drinks again.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.290
We spilled the first one.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.460
SPLASH

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.840
-Sorry, Toritsuka!
-I'm so sorry!

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.050
Are you okay, Suzumiya-san?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.010
TA-DA

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:05.380
Gosh, it's a mess.

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.340
BA-DUMP

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.430
-Sorry! I was trying to protect you!
-Thank you...

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:11.140
<i>I hugged her!</i>

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.470
<i>That brat!</i>

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.930
<i>Good job, Satou-kun.</i>
<i>Toritsuka received even more damage.</i>

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.440
Your textbook was ruined, too.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.520
-But you're lucky.
-Why?

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.360
Because you've memorized
the textbook contents.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.190
<i>He has no malicious intent,</i>
<i>but he is intensifying his anger.</i>

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.700
-You can use my textbook.
-Yes, thank you.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.530
-Hii-chan.
-Thank you, Toritsuka-kun.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.990
Will you go on a date with me
this afternoon?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.450
<i>A date?</i>

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.830
<i>Are they dating?</i>

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.830
<i>Did you hear that? A mob guy?</i>

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.750
<i>Don't you get it?</i>
<i>You'll be killed if you date her.</i>

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.880
<i>I'm ready to accept that. I'll die</i>
<i>before I let a mob guy take my girl away.</i>

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:45.800
<i>She isn't yours.</i>

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.760
-Please!
<i>-Don't worry. She is in love with me.</i>

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.220
<i>That'll teach you, mob guy.</i>

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:50.720
Thank you for asking.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.850
Sorry, but I can't.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:53.930
<i>He lost.</i>

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.390
I have plans.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.680
Don't worry about our plans.

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:59.890
I have a plan with Satou-kun.

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.350
HAPPINESS SCALE

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.360
<i>It fell beyond the limit.</i>

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.690
-Are you guys going on a date?
-No!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:08.360
My house burned down yesterday
and my pen case was reduced to cinders,

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.570
so he will take me to a stationery shop.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.160
<i>Don't talk like you only lost your phone.</i>

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.620
<i>She is prioritizing our plans.</i>

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.580
I see. That's convenient, then.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.370
I wanted to go to a stationery shop, too.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.960
<i>Not just the two of us...</i>

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.960
<i>Well, his happiness decreased.</i>

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.630
<i>Toritsuka is not used to being loved,</i>
<i>but isn't he too desperate?</i>

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.090
Here it is.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:32.680
Welcome.

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.180
<i>Was it really okay to follow them here?</i>

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.390
<i>I guess I worry too much.</i>
<i>It's just a stationery shop.</i>

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.770
Toritsuka-kun, look at these.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.140
Which one do you think is better?
Red or blue?

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.060
COMPASS DIVIDERS

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.020
PALE BLUE
RED BLOOD

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:46.480
Oh, my God! I'm sorry! Are you all right?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.440
I'm fine...

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.360
<i>Let's go home now...</i>

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.690
-I'm sorry.
-<i>He's discouraged already.</i>

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:50.780
Satou-kun.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:54.490
<i>You're going to take care of her.</i>
<i>I won't forgive you if you make her cry.</i>

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:55.950
<i>May you be happy!</i>

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.040
Where did he go?

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.160
-I don't know.
-<i>I did it right.</i>

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.750
<i>I wish her happiness.</i>
<i>She should be with him.</i>

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:06.460
<i>I will withdraw myself.</i>
<i>So, this is called a "heartbreak."</i>

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.840
<i>Stop being sentimental.</i>

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.340
<i>You just retreated from there.</i>

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.130
Sa... Saiki-san, were you there?

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.050
<i>You didn't step aside.</i>
<i>You were just a chicken.</i>

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:18.140
That's right. Hii-chan is too much
to handle. The mob guy can have her!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:21.980
<i>I repeat. She is not yours. But even</i>
<i>he's retreated. She's out of control.</i>

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.230
<i>I wonder what causes her troubles.</i>

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:28.320
<i>Doesn't she have a spirit guide</i>
<i>that you often talk about?</i>

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:29.780
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:34.360
I finally know the cause.
She's got such a despicable spirit guide!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.990
<i>That's far worse than expected.</i>

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:41.000
TORITSUKA VS. SATOU! FIGHTING OVER
RIGHTS TO DATE! (SECOND VOLUME)

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.160
<i>Continued from the last episode.</i>

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.960
<i>Why have I never noticed him?</i>

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.590
<i>But if I can make him do his job,</i>
<i>she will be better off.</i>

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:48.590
<i>Can you?</i>

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:53.380
Yes, if we work together! I will be your
eyes, and you'll tell him to do his job.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:54.550
<i>I see.</i>

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.590
Alright! Hii-chan will be mine
if her luck improves.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.220
<i>I didn't say that I will.</i>

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.640
<i>Give up on her, then I will help you.</i>

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:03.810
What? It would defeat the purpose!

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:07.360
<i>I'm on Satou-kun's side.</i>
<i>And you just said that you'd withdraw.</i>

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.440
Forget about it.
There's nothing in it for me.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.780
<i>See you, then.</i>

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.320
Gah!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:19.080
Okay! I will do as you say.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.950
Let's help her out.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.830
I don't have sake.
I don't have any motivation.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.590
Hey! Why don't you protect her
if you are her spirit guide?

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:33.550
Shut up! Shut up! You shut up!
Just give me sake.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.760
Because you are like that,
she's been so unfortunate.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:37.680
Shut up!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.260
<i>Toritsuka, wait. I've got an interruption.</i>

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:43.350
Kusuo-kun! So good to see you.
What are you doing here?

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:47.310
I was on my way to your house.
I was hoping to notify you in advance.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.690
<i>You've never notified me before.</i>

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.190
It's lucky that I met you
on your way home.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:56.320
You're Toritsuka-kun from class 2.
You're one of the PK Psychickers, right?

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.910
It's a stationery shop.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:58.820
<i>Saiki-san!</i>

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.240
<i>I can't be bothered to make him leave.</i>
<i>Let him help us.</i>

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:04.160
<i>Akechi, put your hand on my shoulder,</i>
<i>like this.</i>

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.620
-<i>Like this?</i>
-<i>See?</i>

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:09.540
What's that? I know.
It must be a so-called spirit guide.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.460
But he doesn't seem to be doing his job.

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:15.760
Am I seeing him with your psychic ability?

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.880
<i>This is Toritsuka's psychic medium power</i>
<i>conveyed to you through me.</i>

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:23.470
I see. So some spirit guides
may look like him. I was surprised.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.930
I wasn't so surprised
that I'd pee my pants, though.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.690
Saiki-san! Why did you let him in?

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.520
<i>Akechi, do you know</i>
<i>why the spirit guide has become like that?</i>

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.030
That poop on his head is a fake.
It doesn't decay.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:38.610
He thinks it's a hat?
And he probably thinks the arrow is cool.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:42.030
The arrow looks very old.
His loincloth looks even older.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.330
It's very worn out,
so it must be hundreds of years old.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:48.250
It's too loose to cover his thing.
I believe he used to be stylish,

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.920
but he didn't notice
that he has misdirected himself.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:54.500
And that brought him unhappiness,
which then brought him more unhappiness.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:58.670
-That's how he came to be like this.
-So, what should we do?

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.430
<i>Are we going to solve this?</i>

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:03.180
What the hell? He has poop on his head.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.180
<i>Your spirit guide?</i>

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:08.560
-See you tomorrow, Kusuo-kun.
-Look at you, so filthy. I see your nuts.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.730
Shut up! Shut up! You all just go to hell!
Bring me sake!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.650
You stink.

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.020
-You want me to throw my poop at you?
-Bring it on!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:16.400
<i>Are you okay without a spirit guide?</i>

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:20.400
Your spirit guide is really powerful,
so I should be fine for a little while.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:21.410
<i>It's news to me.</i>

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.290
<i>The Nendou-like spirit guide took the</i>
<i>useless spirit guide to training.</i>

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:29.370
<i>He got a new loincloth,</i>
<i>and they became close to each other.</i>

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.540
<i>They safely returned</i>
<i>to Hidariwakibara Town.</i>

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.920
Looks like he just took a bath.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:34.920
<i>Can we really trust him?</i>

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.460
I've got a new loincloth, sir.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.840
<i>He still has poop on his head.</i>

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.800
He's turned back to his old self.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:42.180
He's recovered!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:44.140
I will do my best
as a good spirit guide...

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.180
He could become useless again.

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:46.850
<i>Wasn't it all about his loincloth?</i>

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.310
Hey, you're wearing <i>geta.</i>

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.270
-I always do.
-<i>To stand out.</i>

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.480
Give them to me!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.110
I can give them to you,
but spirits like you can't wear them.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.520
-<i>Do a memorial service.</i>
-I see.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:58.030
<i>His </i>geta<i> were sent to a memorial service</i>
<i>right away. Then...</i>

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.030
I am willing to risk my life
to protect her.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.490
<i>Yeah, that's good.</i>

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.620
TA-DA

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.330
Yay! I can locate Kusuo
with my precognition ability!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.370
<i>Will you look at Hii-chan's aura?</i>

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.460
Okay! Wipe out your aura for a sec,
will you?

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:17.380
Wow! It's totally different!
That sinister aura has gone!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.630
<i>I'm glad to hear that.</i>

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.090
What do you mean?

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.550
I never thought it
could be solved this easily.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:29.350
If I had figured it out earlier,
she'd have been mine...

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.520
<i>I feel good, having done a good deed.</i>

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.640
I don't feel good at all!
I have to give up Hii-chan!

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:34.730
<i>Did I say that?</i>

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.860
<i>You will be rejected soon anyway.</i>

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.030
Subtitle translation by Kanako Murakoshi
